      "name": "SEL-351A-1 Protection System",
      "summary": "<p>The SEL-351A Protection System has built-in Ethernet and IEEE C37.118 synchrophasors, and is the economical solution for overcurrent protection. Easy-to-use feeder protection and innovative features like SEL’s Best Choice Ground Directional Element logic and <span class=\"sm-caps\">SELogic</span> control equations provide superior protection on utility and industrial power systems.</p>",
      "revision": "7",
      "imageUrls": [
        "uploadedImages/Web/Products/Images/351a.png?n=63677058143000"
      ],
      "standardFeatures": [
        {
          "contentData": [
            {
              "html": {
                "content": "<ul><li>Ethernet</li><li>IEEE C37.118 Synchrophasor Measurement</li><li>DNP3 Outstation</li><li>Modbus TCP/RTU</li><li>Telnet</li><li>FTP</li><li>Web Server</li><li>SNTP</li><li>Operator Controls and LCD</li><li>8 Outputs (OUT101 and OUT102 are configured as Hybrid High-Current Interrupting output contacts)</li><li>6 Inputs</li><li>Conventional Terminal Blocks</li><li><a href=\"/software/downloads/?search=SEL-5030%20Software\">Download <span class=\"sm-caps\">acSELerator</span> QuickSet SEL-5030</a>.  <span class=\"sm-caps\">acSELerator</span> QuickSet on CD (503001WX4) is available upon request.</li></ul> <p>Accepts single-phase voltage up to 300V line-neutral or three-phase voltages up to 300V line-neutral, wye or delta connection configurable via global setting.</p>"
